        "text": "This domain intentionally mixes minimum-height and attribute-heavy classes.\n\nA good result keeps full names, multiplicities and both endpoint roles legible. Crossings should be traceable; route editing and undo must preserve every connection.\n\nUnicode: café, Straße, Ångström, 日本語.",
